{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102080013474-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102081221\"/><p>今日吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>廣東沿岸風勢微弱，天色大致良好。今日(2日)上午8時，天文台錄得氣溫攝氏27度，相對濕度百分之80。過去一小時，京士柏錄得的平均紫外線指數是0.3，強度屬於低。</p><p>預測今日大致天晴，日間炎熱，市區最高氣溫約攝氏31度，新界再高一兩度。稍後部分時間多雲，有一兩陣微雨。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。展望未來一兩日風勢較大。星期四(5日)部分時間有陽光。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.229000+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T00:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:22.228984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:36.980152+00:00","content_hash":"0fa81202c68214d3483fc71e0b37b186bd8ca261874128a39217f32a4e706674","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.229000+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}